        "content": "<p>Greetings all,</p>\n<p>We (myself, <span class=\"user-mention\" data-user-id=\"418216\">@George Pîrlea</span> and  <span class=\"user-mention\" data-user-id=\"702586\">@Ilya Sergey</span> ) are happy to announce LeanSSR, an SSReflect-style tactic language for Lean 4.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/verse-lab/lean-ssr\">Sources and examples</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/verse-lab/lean-ssr/wiki\">LeanSSR tactic language Wiki</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2403.12733\">The paper</a> containing a LeanSSR tutorial and a discussion of its implementation</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Please, give it a try in your project and let us know about your experience. Contributions are welcome!</p>",
